  - name: JVM Stuck Thread 
    detail: The stuck thread count exceeds a threshold
    fluxfile: flux/jvm_stuck_thread.flux
    severity: 1
    threshold: 0
    comparison: gt
    tags: 
      - host
      - _field
      - _measurement
      - wls_ServerRuntime
    interval: 120
    target: xapi
    action: | 
              This alert indicates that the affected WLS Managed Server is suffering from a locking issue, possible deadlock. 
              The managed server will most likely need to be restarted. 